        "original_id": "c314b3f6-9784-5368-8f85-c8a6e3fb9227",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Stolberg, Jack Black, Todd Phillips, Alexandre Aja, Laura Ziskin\n- Films: Man-Witch, Piranha 3D, House on Sorority Row, The Life Coach, Piranha\n- Books: The Spellman Files, The Candy Shop Wars\n- Topics: screenwriting, remakes, book adaptations, directing\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, Josh Stolberg directed the mockumentary film \"The Life Coach.\"\n- In 2010, \"Piranha 3D\" was released as an American 3D horror comedy film and served as a loose remake of the 1978 film \"Piranha.\"\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the script for \"Man-Witch,\" which starred Jack Black and was directed by Todd Phillips.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the remake of \"Piranha 3D,\" which was directed by Alexandre Aja.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the remake of \"House on Sorority Row.\"\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the book adaptation of \"The Spellman Files,\" which was produced by Laura Ziskin.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the book adaptation of \"The Candy Shop Wars.\"",
